+      result: "rejected: 'Challenge and solution theorem statement do not match: BGP212.Challenge.gdtH_minimal_period'"
+      note: "The weakened statement is false: gdtH_minimal_period_needs_shift is a counterexample."
+    - change: "changed the W-trick residue 74549147 to 74549148 in h45_wtrick_W23 in the Challenge"
+      result: "rejected: 'Challenge and solution theorem statement do not match: BGP212.Challenge.h45_wtrick_W23'"
+  sandbox: >
+    Comparator ran with the pass-through landrun stand-in in the authoring environment.
+    Rerun ./verify.sh on the VPS with the real landrun to record a sandboxed result.
+
+result:
